      "row_index_0based": 7,
      "serialized_row_index": 7,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "僕はフリスさんから食事に誘われて、\n彼女の住処までやってきていた。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "111114e05674079bcda12c959722490727cf36d4413c49ac53c6a77b25b0aad1",
