      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "以前、辛いものを大変そうに食べていたことを思い出して、\n食べやすい野菜などを持ち込んでいたのだが――。",
      "jp_sha256": "b0f467ce9793256be30db7364712f3fa8244736b114b6b670c52fc213cb46a44",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "예전에 매운 것을 힘겹게 먹던 일이 떠올라,\n먹기 편한 채소 따위를 가져왔지만――.",
      "message_index_0based": 1,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 9,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b007-20261106-398afd64-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "f141bf2dc29c3a29296179145aa3fa67970c98e47c8ee5721429257f10c6ecaf:000000_-3542472672250371368:g0:r8",
      "row_index_0based": 8,
      "serialized_row_index": 8,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "以前、辛いものを大変そうに食べていたことを思い出して、\n食べやすい野菜などを持ち込んでいたのだが――。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "224d8d834098102ee32e0649073f0fb9aec1a5026495e982970333c0aa4490f4",
